<title>USA: Chang joins Apple's board of directors.</title>
<headline>Chang joins Apple's board of directors.</headline>
<dateline>CUPERTINO, Calif. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apple Computer Inc Tuesday said Gareth Chang has joined the company's board of directors.</p>
<p>Chang, 53, is corporate senior vice president, marketing, of Hughes Electronics Corporation, president of Hughes International, a member of the Office of the Chairman of Hughes Electronics, and is responsible for worldwide operations and the corporate business development function of the company. Hughes is a unit of General Motors Corp.</p>
</text>
